enuine concern: The tone is comedic, not genuinely concerned.\n\nThe remark conveys sarcasm by presenting an absurd, impossible scenario as a humorous alternative, which is a form of implying an absurd improvement or alternative through exaggeration.\n\nAnswer: \boxed{A}
